1
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:46,000
Is his family member here?

2
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:46,560
I'm here.

3
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,920
What is your relationship
with the patient?

4
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:47,960
[Resuscitation Area]

5
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,180
I'm his sister.

6
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:50,670
This is a notice of critical condition.

7
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,330
[Resuscitation Area]

8
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:51,530
Please sign it.

9
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,640
Shan.

10
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:56,750
When you laid out
what happened to our parents

11
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:58,390
in front of me,

12
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:01,360
I resented you, hated you,

13
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:03,000
[Signature of Guardian]

14
00:01:01,670 --> 00:01:03,200
and wanted to push you away.

15
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:06,230
But when I received
the notice of critical condition,

16
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:07,680
[Signature of Guardian: Chen Ying]

17
00:01:06,230 --> 00:01:07,430
I finally understood

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,190
that this bond without blood ties

19
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:12,539
has already seeped into my bones.

20
00:02:46,579 --> 00:02:51,400
[Light the Dark]

21
00:02:52,390 --> 00:02:55,070
[Episode 7]

22
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:59,250
[Wugang County Red Cross Hospital]

23
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,590
I just asked them.

24
00:03:11,710 --> 00:03:12,520
Shan is now

25
00:03:12,550 --> 00:03:13,790
out of danger.

26
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,980
Don't worry.

27
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,620
You two, come out with me for a moment.

28
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:39,710
Which of you is his family member?

29
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:41,440
She is.

30
00:03:41,470 --> 00:03:43,490
She is Chen Shan's sister, Chen Ying.

31
00:03:43,490 --> 00:03:45,190
The traffic accident liability report
is out.

32
00:03:45,190 --> 00:03:46,590
Your brother, Chen Shan,

33
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:48,400
was driving drunk without a license

34
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:50,120
and is suspected of
causing a traffic accident.

35
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,800
We need to keep him under supervision.

36
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,870
Causing a traffic accident?

37
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:55,310
Family members
are temporarily not allowed to visit.

38
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:56,000
Well...

39
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:58,329
Will my brother be sentenced?

40
00:03:58,590 --> 00:04:00,280
That depends on the court's verdict.

41
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,540
Just wait for the news.

42
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:55,540
Will Shan go to jail?

43
00:04:57,860 --> 00:05:00,140
He just graduated from college.

44
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:02,040
What will happen

45
00:05:02,060 --> 00:05:03,650
to his future?

46
00:05:05,950 --> 00:05:07,470
What should I do?

47
00:05:15,350 --> 00:05:16,150
Ying.

48
00:05:16,540 --> 00:05:17,590
Don't worry.

49
00:05:18,330 --> 00:05:19,130
I'll find

50
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:21,070
a few lawyers to ask around.

51
00:05:21,970 --> 00:05:23,970
It should be fine. It should be fine.

52
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:39,520
[Nurses' Station]

53
00:05:52,750 --> 00:05:53,390
Nurse.

54
00:05:54,070 --> 00:05:55,600
The patient is awake. Go get the doctor.

55
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,070
Okay.

56
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,160
Ma...

57
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:08,040
Where is Ma Yiming?

58
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,310
Ma Yiming is dead.

59
00:06:15,290 --> 00:06:16,120
Chen Shan.

60
00:06:16,510 --> 00:06:17,900
Calm down, Chen Shan.

61
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:19,430
Chen Shan.

62
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,360
Impossible.

63
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,010
Chen Shan, Chen Shan.

64
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,600
He can't be dead.

65
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,870
Chen Shan, calm down.

66
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,400
Chen Shan, Chen Shan.

67
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:27,190
Chen Shan.

68
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,190
Chen Shan!

69
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:29,430
Chen Shan!

70
00:06:29,510 --> 00:06:31,680
You murderer!

71
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:33,210
My son took you in

72
00:06:33,230 --> 00:06:34,230
and treated you so well!

73
00:06:34,230 --> 00:06:36,360
Why did you kill him?

74
00:06:36,510 --> 00:06:38,370
Why did you kill him?

75
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:39,720
I'm sorry, Ma'am.

76
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:40,900
Sorry?

77
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,730
Can an apology bring back

78
00:06:42,750 --> 00:06:45,260
my son's life?

79
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,600
What's the use of an apology?

80
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,600
Ma'am, I'm sorry.

81
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:50,510
Why wasn't it you who died?

82
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:52,000
-Ma'am.
-And you're perfectly fine now.

83
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:52,950
Ma'am, we are questioning him.

84
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:53,850
Ma'am.

85
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:55,970
Ma'am, you can't do this, Ma'am.

86
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:58,430
-Ma'am, let's go. Ma'am.
-Why didn't you die?

87
00:06:58,430 --> 00:07:00,510
Why wasn't it you who died?

88
00:07:00,510 --> 00:07:02,090
You're still fine.

89
00:07:24,750 --> 00:07:26,610
How about we become

90
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,240
sworn brothers tonight?

91
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,080
Sure.

92
00:07:29,190 --> 00:07:30,680
From now on,

93
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,950
your mom is my mom.

94
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,040
Then,

95
00:07:37,190 --> 00:07:39,040
we weren't born on the same day,

96
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:41,000
but we wish to die on the same day.

97
00:07:41,070 --> 00:07:41,870
Say something auspicious.

98
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:42,800
Say something auspicious.

99
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,600
Come on, here's to us brothers

100
00:07:44,620 --> 00:07:46,150
getting better and better.

101
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:44,530
I saved a spot for Mom and Dad.

102
00:08:45,030 --> 00:08:46,490
You can just hang it there.

103
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:52,600
I won't hang it here.

104
00:09:06,910 --> 00:09:08,820
What... what is this?

105
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,480
They gave it to me.

106
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,000
Ying.

107
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,600
I washed some fruit.

108
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:24,080
Now,

109
00:09:25,390 --> 00:09:27,390
shouldn't you call me Peng Xiaoyun?

110
00:09:28,270 --> 00:09:30,080
Look, I forgot.

111
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:32,000
Right, Xiaoyun.

112
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,140
Xiaoyun, Xiaoyun.

113
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,150
Hello?

114
00:09:48,190 --> 00:09:49,310
Okay, I got it.

115
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:55,000
Xiaoyun,

116
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,900
the plant office just called.

117
00:09:59,300 --> 00:10:00,110
Chen Shan

118
00:10:01,100 --> 00:10:01,910
was sentenced

119
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,510
to 3 years.

120
00:10:13,870 --> 00:10:15,150
I want to see him.

121
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:19,000
Okay, I'll contact them right away

122
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,850
and see what we need to prepare.

123
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:39,180
[Two months later]

124
00:10:35,510 --> 00:10:36,790
Right face!

125
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,840
At ease!

126
00:10:39,470 --> 00:10:40,270
Attention!

127
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:43,080
[Save Food. No Waste.]

128
00:11:07,390 --> 00:11:08,460
Time to eat!

129
00:11:07,570 --> 00:11:11,530
[Save Food. No Waste.]

130
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,140
Sit!

131
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,880
Our place is under maintenance.

132
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:33,360
I was just transferred from another squad.

133
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:35,420
Otherwise, I wouldn't have seen you.

134
00:11:36,670 --> 00:11:37,950
How did you get in?

135
00:11:38,670 --> 00:11:40,200
How long have you been here?

136
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:47,830
Quiet!

137
00:11:47,150 --> 00:11:50,670
[Save Food. No Waste.]

138
00:11:48,150 --> 00:11:50,010
Chen Shan, come here for a second.

139
00:11:53,630 --> 00:11:56,440
[Save Food. No Waste.]

140
00:11:55,910 --> 00:11:56,510
Here.

141
00:11:56,510 --> 00:11:57,120
Chen Shan,

142
00:11:57,390 --> 00:11:58,290
the letters you sent to your sister

143
00:11:58,290 --> 00:11:59,620
have all been returned.

144
00:11:59,630 --> 00:12:00,440
How...

145
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,150
How could they be returned?

146
00:12:02,150 --> 00:12:03,510
No such person at the mailing address.

147
00:12:03,510 --> 00:12:05,110
No one received the letters.

148
00:12:09,060 --> 00:12:09,870
Wait.

149
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:10,870
Then,

150
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,180
can you do me a favor

151
00:12:12,180 --> 00:12:13,430
and contact her?

152
00:12:13,910 --> 00:12:14,850
You guys...

153
00:12:14,870 --> 00:12:15,480
Chen Shan,

154
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:16,370
go eat.

155
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:18,660
-Wait, you don't allow me to see her—
-Go.

156
00:13:01,670 --> 00:13:02,240
Stop!

157
00:13:02,790 --> 00:13:03,840
Put your hands on your heads
and squat down!

158
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:04,270
Squat down, all of you!

159
00:13:04,270 --> 00:13:05,030
Behave yourselves!

160
00:13:05,030 --> 00:13:06,890
-Hands on your head!
-Squat down!

161
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,820
I'll kill you!

162
00:13:16,870 --> 00:13:17,740
Move!

163
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:18,740
Get up!

164
00:13:19,270 --> 00:13:20,120
Get up!

165
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:21,110
Come with me!

166
00:13:22,390 --> 00:13:23,070
Move!

167
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:40,470
On the morning of the explosion,

168
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:42,150
outside the valve pit,

169
00:13:42,150 --> 00:13:43,410
I saw Qi Mo.

170
00:13:43,750 --> 00:13:45,440
Generally, at emergency repair sites,

171
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:47,300
designers don't need to be there.

172
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:50,100
Ma Yiming definitely wouldn't lie to me.

173
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:52,630
Now Qi Mo is married to Ying.

174
00:13:52,650 --> 00:13:53,720
What if Qi Mo really

175
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,600
has something to do with my dad's death?

176
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,440
Then Ying...

177
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,240
No.

178
00:13:58,550 --> 00:13:59,510
I have to find a way

179
00:13:59,510 --> 00:14:01,240
to see Ying as soon as possible.

180
00:14:05,870 --> 00:14:07,910
Okay, thank you.

181
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:23,200
Here.

182
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:25,550
Let's eat.

183
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:34,760
What's wrong?

184
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:37,750
The prison called.

185
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,280
They said I'm not Shan's

186
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:41,740
immediate family member.

187
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:44,130
So I can't visit.

188
00:14:48,510 --> 00:14:50,370
Why do they still have such a rule?

189
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:52,480
Don't worry.

190
00:14:52,910 --> 00:14:54,510
We'll figure something out.

191
00:14:56,630 --> 00:14:57,440
Come on.

192
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:58,890
Let's eat first.

193
00:15:14,790 --> 00:15:15,600
Go in.

194
00:15:21,790 --> 00:15:23,080
Stand next to Sun Jie.

195
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,240
Chen Shan,

196
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:30,120
Sun Jie said

197
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:30,960
your parents and he used

198
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,200
to work in the same plant.

199
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,550
He watched you grow up,

200
00:15:33,550 --> 00:15:34,150
so he applied for you and him

201
00:15:34,150 --> 00:15:35,080
to stay in the same cell.

202
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:35,890
We considered that

203
00:15:35,890 --> 00:15:36,870
this would help with your rehabilitation.

204
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:38,120
Hope you reform yourself well.

205
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:38,910
Copy that.

206
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:55,830
This is the new cell.

207
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:56,910
Greet him!

208
00:16:00,070 --> 00:16:01,440
Are you deaf?

209
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,300
That's enough!

210
00:16:04,270 --> 00:16:05,150
Dismissed.

211
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:51,270
Did I wake you up?

212
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:54,240
I even moved outside on purpose,

213
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,940
but I still woke you up, didn't I?

214
00:16:55,940 --> 00:16:58,270
What are you doing so early
in the morning?

215
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:00,510
Aren't you pregnant now?

216
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:03,000
You can't keep eating the food at work.

217
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:04,160
The dishes in the cafeteria

218
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,720
are not nutritious and too greasy.

219
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,470
I was thinking, I'll cook

220
00:17:07,490 --> 00:17:08,589
breakfast and lunch for you from now on.

221
00:17:08,589 --> 00:17:10,030
According to the standard
for pregnant women,

222
00:17:10,030 --> 00:17:11,589
you should eat nutritious meals.

223
00:17:11,589 --> 00:17:12,510
I'll make them for you

224
00:17:12,510 --> 00:17:13,750
and pack them in a lunchbox,

225
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:15,609
and you can take them to the plant.

226
00:17:17,510 --> 00:17:19,170
Careful, I'm holding a knife.

227
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,920
You're so sweet.

228
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:28,440
Right now,

229
00:17:29,070 --> 00:17:31,800
as long as you're happy,
that's all that matters.

230
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:36,030
I wonder how Shan is eating.

231
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:45,030
Come here.

232
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:49,830
Xiaoyun.

233
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:54,200
I know you're worried
about Shan right now,

234
00:17:55,070 --> 00:17:57,200
but the most important thing right now

235
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:59,400
is you and the baby in your belly.

236
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:01,720
Look.

237
00:18:03,510 --> 00:18:04,310
Baby,

238
00:18:05,510 --> 00:18:06,880
hurry and wake up.

239
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:09,720
Get up and persuade your mom

240
00:18:09,790 --> 00:18:11,920
to stop worrying.

241
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:13,490
Your mom needs to be happy.

242
00:18:14,830 --> 00:18:15,830
Tell your mom,

243
00:18:15,830 --> 00:18:17,640
"Pay more attention to me.

244
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:19,270
When I grow up,

245
00:18:19,310 --> 00:18:20,960
Uncle will be back.

246
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:24,140
By the time he comes back,

247
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,550
I'll be 2 years old."

248
00:18:27,550 --> 00:18:28,350
Time to eat!

249
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,340
Sit!

250
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,330
Enough.

251
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:53,010
Give him a little.

252
00:18:53,070 --> 00:18:53,590
Bro,

253
00:18:54,350 --> 00:18:56,610
this kid hasn't eaten or drunk for 2 days.

254
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:13,580
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

255
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:11,720
Right now, the plant

256
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:12,590
has reached a point

257
00:19:12,590 --> 00:19:14,640
where reform and transformation
are inevitable.

258
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:15,770
Starting tomorrow,

259
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:18,750
our plant will be responsible
for its own profits and losses,

260
00:19:18,750 --> 00:19:20,720
and we have to forge our own path.

261
00:19:20,610 --> 00:19:22,320
[All-Staff Meeting of Wugang Petrochemical
Gas Distribution Plant]

262
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:35,160
Next, the plant

263
00:19:35,550 --> 00:19:37,410
will make personnel adjustments

264
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:38,810
and reassignments.

265
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:40,920
I will also focus on promoting

266
00:19:41,550 --> 00:19:42,510
capable

267
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:44,710
and competent young key personnel.

268
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,960
At the same time,
we will also dismiss a batch of

269
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:49,270
employees who do not meet
the transformation requirements.

270
00:19:49,270 --> 00:19:50,350
The personnel

271
00:19:49,410 --> 00:19:52,250
[All-Staff Meeting of Wugang Petrochemical
Gas Distribution Plant]

272
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:51,750
adjustment list

273
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:54,190
will be publicized in a week.

274
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,420
Wait, what does this mean?

275
00:19:57,510 --> 00:19:59,200
We've worked hard for the plant

276
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:00,240
for half our lives,

277
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:01,680
and now we're just dismissed?

278
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:03,640
What's the rush?

279
00:20:04,270 --> 00:20:06,680
The list hasn't been announced yet.

280
00:20:09,350 --> 00:20:10,200
Comrades.

281
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,790
When the leader is speaking,

282
00:20:12,790 --> 00:20:14,160
let's not talk.

283
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:15,920
Let the director finish.

284
00:20:16,110 --> 00:20:17,510
Otherwise, we won't know

285
00:20:17,620 --> 00:20:18,960
what it's about.

286
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:23,510
Also,

287
00:20:24,070 --> 00:20:25,310
some of our comrades

288
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:29,050
have been demoted
and are no longer leaders,

289
00:20:29,050 --> 00:20:30,850
but they still act like leaders,

290
00:20:31,030 --> 00:20:32,750
bossing people around

291
00:20:32,830 --> 00:20:34,030
and forming cliques.

292
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:35,610
This kind of situation

293
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:38,730
will absolutely not be allowed
in the future.

294
00:20:44,070 --> 00:20:45,330
Deputy Director Geng.

295
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:46,480
Look,

296
00:20:46,510 --> 00:20:48,880
there's been a lot going on
at the plant lately.

297
00:20:48,880 --> 00:20:51,000
We just want to hear your thoughts.

298
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:51,800
You are now

299
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:52,960
our backbone.

300
00:20:53,070 --> 00:20:53,880
Yes.

301
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,310
I know exactly

302
00:20:56,310 --> 00:20:57,960
why you guys are here.

303
00:20:58,960 --> 00:20:59,680
As for Qi Mo,

304
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:01,590
he's young

305
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:03,110
and aggressive.

306
00:21:03,110 --> 00:21:04,440
A new broom sweeps clean.

307
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:05,700
It's understandable.

308
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:06,830
It's true

309
00:21:07,030 --> 00:21:08,830
that he's a bit rash.

310
00:21:08,830 --> 00:21:09,520
A bit rash.

311
00:21:09,550 --> 00:21:10,160
Look,

312
00:21:10,350 --> 00:21:12,790
-Deputy Director Geng has sharp eyes.
-Yes.

313
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:13,440
The plant

314
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:15,240
needs someone like you to keep watch.

315
00:21:15,240 --> 00:21:16,100
-Yes.
-Really.

316
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:18,160
The plant is getting
more and more chaotic.

317
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:18,920
I think he's just

318
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:19,880
an inexperienced

319
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:20,960
youngster.

320
00:21:21,070 --> 00:21:22,960
There are still projects in the plant.

321
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:25,400
If everyone just quits,

322
00:21:25,550 --> 00:21:27,480
he won't be able
to be the director anymore.

323
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:28,110
You guys stay here.

324
00:21:28,110 --> 00:21:29,000
Stay here and drink tea.

325
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:30,550
Because I have to go back.

326
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:31,400
No, no, no.

327
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:32,550
Let's eat together, come on.

328
00:21:32,550 --> 00:21:33,310
I'm not going.

329
00:21:33,310 --> 00:21:34,030
I've already eaten.

330
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:34,720
It's just upstairs.

331
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:36,070
I can't eat anymore.

332
00:21:36,070 --> 00:21:36,830
Let's go.

333
00:21:37,030 --> 00:21:38,270
You guys just go.

334
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:39,530
It's just upstairs.

335
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:40,550
Let's go.

336
00:21:40,550 --> 00:21:41,110
Really.

337
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:54,140
Are you on a hunger strike?

338
00:21:54,310 --> 00:21:55,840
Do you want to die that much?

339
00:22:01,590 --> 00:22:02,400
What?

340
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:03,500
What are you doing?

341
00:22:04,590 --> 00:22:05,360
Don't move.

342
00:22:05,830 --> 00:22:06,690
You have to eat.

343
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:09,980
The King of Hell doesn't accept ghosts
who starve to death.

344
00:22:10,070 --> 00:22:10,880
Eat.

345
00:22:13,880 --> 00:22:14,510
Eat.

346
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:20,420
Wait, what does this mean?

347
00:22:20,830 --> 00:22:22,870
Dismissing us with just a piece of paper?

348
00:22:22,490 --> 00:22:24,490
[Notice on the Release of the Plant's
First Batch of Laid‑off Staff List]

349
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:24,590
We're laid off just like that?

350
00:22:24,590 --> 00:22:26,350
How could Qi Mo treat us like this?

351
00:22:26,350 --> 00:22:27,160
Qi Mo.

352
00:22:27,710 --> 00:22:29,170
[Geng Jian, Feng Jian,
Hu Haiqing, Sun Qianqian]

353
00:22:29,190 --> 00:22:30,850
[He Jianchuan, Zhang Weiping,
Chen Xuejun, Zhao Zhiguo]

354
00:22:30,890 --> 00:22:31,110
[Director's Office]

355
00:22:32,960 --> 00:22:34,890
What about the supply department?

356
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:36,550
And the security department?

357
00:22:36,550 --> 00:22:38,350
Okay, then let's do it this way.

358
00:22:39,840 --> 00:22:41,300
C-Can I ask

359
00:22:41,750 --> 00:22:43,310
why my name is suddenly

360
00:22:43,310 --> 00:22:45,350
on the layoff list?

361
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:47,640
I'll call you back later.

362
00:22:48,510 --> 00:22:49,270
Godfather.

363
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:52,480
I didn't want to bring this

364
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,640
out in the open.

365
00:22:54,350 --> 00:22:55,270
Let me ask you,

366
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:56,550
the department you manage

367
00:22:56,550 --> 00:22:58,480
has been at the bottom
in performance every year.

368
00:22:58,480 --> 00:23:00,200
If you were not on the layoff list,

369
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:01,920
how could I convince the others?

370
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:04,250
Also, you instigated them to make trouble

371
00:23:04,830 --> 00:23:06,200
at the construction site, didn't you?

372
00:23:06,200 --> 00:23:07,070
I didn't!

373
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:09,610
In the teahouse private room,

374
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,510
you, He Jianchuan,

375
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:13,240
Feng Jian, and Department Chief Gao

376
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:14,830
instigated people to make trouble

377
00:23:14,830 --> 00:23:16,230
and divided the workers.

378
00:23:16,440 --> 00:23:18,500
Is this what plant leaders should do?

379
00:23:18,550 --> 00:23:19,270
I...

380
00:23:19,510 --> 00:23:20,770
Whichever way the boat

381
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:22,400
on the river heads,

382
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:23,350
we must

383
00:23:23,350 --> 00:23:25,150
pull together to keep it steady.

384
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:26,680
If you had

385
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:27,880
stopped them in time,

386
00:23:28,040 --> 00:23:29,240
the plant wouldn't have

387
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:30,700
suffered such a huge loss.

388
00:23:30,790 --> 00:23:32,280
As the deputy director,

389
00:23:33,160 --> 00:23:34,720
you are responsible for this oversight.

390
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:36,270
I'm already being lenient

391
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:38,640
by not asking you to compensate

392
00:23:38,640 --> 00:23:40,240
for the plant's losses.

393
00:23:40,790 --> 00:23:41,550
Who told you that?

394
00:23:41,550 --> 00:23:42,450
Enough.

395
00:23:42,590 --> 00:23:43,860
I have a meeting now.

396
00:23:46,310 --> 00:23:47,640
Think it over yourself.

397
00:23:56,310 --> 00:23:57,550
A bunch of villains!

398
00:23:58,680 --> 00:23:59,670
Qi Mo!

399
00:23:59,830 --> 00:24:00,640
Come out!

400
00:24:00,750 --> 00:24:02,000
Give us an explanation!

401
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:03,570
What are you doing? What are you doing?

402
00:24:03,570 --> 00:24:04,490
I'm here!

403
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:07,170
Call the security department.

404
00:24:07,790 --> 00:24:08,400
Director.

405
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:09,830
The people in the security department

406
00:24:09,830 --> 00:24:11,590
were all laid off along with Wang Pengju.

407
00:24:11,590 --> 00:24:12,930
Give us an explanation!

408
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,880
Go call the police! Call the police!

409
00:24:14,880 --> 00:24:17,510
-Go ahead. We're not afraid of you!
-Let me tell you,

410
00:24:17,510 --> 00:24:19,110
I already said at the last meeting

411
00:24:19,110 --> 00:24:20,920
that I would compensate everyone

412
00:24:20,920 --> 00:24:23,000
as much as possible.

413
00:24:24,110 --> 00:24:25,370
Since that's the case,

414
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:26,670
every single one of you present today

415
00:24:26,670 --> 00:24:28,070
will have all your subsidies

416
00:24:28,070 --> 00:24:28,960
suspended

417
00:24:28,960 --> 00:24:30,660
from today!

418
00:24:31,030 --> 00:24:33,480
Burning bridges
and biting the hand that feeds you!

419
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:34,300
He Jianchuan,

420
00:24:34,400 --> 00:24:35,270
let's talk about you.

421
00:24:35,270 --> 00:24:36,630
When Chen Fu was alive,

422
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:38,210
you didn't respect him.

423
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:40,410
He dedicated himself

424
00:24:40,430 --> 00:24:41,050
to his work diligently.

425
00:24:41,050 --> 00:24:41,910
What about you?

426
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:43,400
What did you dedicate yourself to?

427
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:45,170
Forming cliques!

428
00:24:45,550 --> 00:24:46,440
The deputy captain

429
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:47,700
of the construction team

430
00:24:47,700 --> 00:24:48,640
you kicked out a few days ago

431
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:50,520
is sitting in my office right now.

432
00:24:50,590 --> 00:24:51,880
Should I invite him over

433
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:52,860
to tell everyone

434
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:55,160
about the dirty things you did back then?

435
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:56,350
Chen Fu passed away.

436
00:24:56,350 --> 00:24:57,730
He died at his post.

437
00:24:57,760 --> 00:24:58,720
He was the pride of our plant.

438
00:24:58,720 --> 00:24:59,350
What about you?

439
00:24:59,350 --> 00:25:00,450
Your departure

440
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,860
is clearing out the black sheep!

441
00:25:02,860 --> 00:25:03,770
That's slander!

442
00:25:03,770 --> 00:25:04,960
Absolute slander!

443
00:25:04,990 --> 00:25:05,480
Feng Jian!

444
00:25:05,480 --> 00:25:06,570
What are you blabbering about here?

445
00:25:06,570 --> 00:25:07,880
You are the most ridiculous!

446
00:25:07,880 --> 00:25:09,680
When my Master Zhang Wenying was here,

447
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:11,030
you couldn't even do a good job

448
00:25:11,030 --> 00:25:12,880
as an assistant.

449
00:25:12,910 --> 00:25:14,270
You're talking nonsense.

450
00:25:14,270 --> 00:25:15,270
You're jealous.

451
00:25:15,350 --> 00:25:16,510
A complete mess!

452
00:25:16,530 --> 00:25:18,590
Why should the plant spend real money

453
00:25:18,590 --> 00:25:19,880
to support a piece of trash like you?

454
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:21,210
Fine, Director Qi,

455
00:25:21,310 --> 00:25:23,060
you said the cadres are at fault,

456
00:25:23,060 --> 00:25:24,060
but what about us?

457
00:25:24,070 --> 00:25:25,170
What did we

458
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,160
do wrong?

459
00:25:26,160 --> 00:25:27,780
Why should we be fired?

460
00:25:27,810 --> 00:25:28,310
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

461
00:25:28,310 --> 00:25:29,680
-Don't make a fuss!
-Give us an explanation!

462
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:30,750
Let's talk about you!

463
00:25:30,750 --> 00:25:32,940
Are you at your post

464
00:25:33,070 --> 00:25:34,670
for more than 2 hours a day?

465
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:36,730
You either arrive late or leave early!

466
00:25:36,730 --> 00:25:37,820
When you're at work,

467
00:25:37,820 --> 00:25:38,780
you just chat,

468
00:25:38,810 --> 00:25:40,510
gossip, and slack off!

469
00:25:40,550 --> 00:25:42,210
And Sun Qianqian next to you!

470
00:25:42,310 --> 00:25:43,800
Don't think I don't know

471
00:25:43,820 --> 00:25:45,000
how you got into the plant.

472
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:46,400
If you're free,

473
00:25:46,850 --> 00:25:47,670
you should go to the prison

474
00:25:47,670 --> 00:25:48,390
and see if he is

475
00:25:48,390 --> 00:25:49,520
comfortable there.

476
00:25:49,570 --> 00:25:50,590
How can you talk like that?

477
00:25:50,590 --> 00:25:53,260
-You've gone too far!
-And you, the one standing high!

478
00:25:53,260 --> 00:25:54,050
Secretary Hu!

479
00:25:54,050 --> 00:25:55,120
What did I do?

480
00:25:55,140 --> 00:25:56,030
While being by Wan Yang's side,

481
00:25:56,030 --> 00:25:57,280
you've never done anything good,

482
00:25:57,280 --> 00:25:58,850
throwing your weight around every day.

483
00:25:58,850 --> 00:25:59,850
If I tell everyone what you did,

484
00:25:59,850 --> 00:26:00,380
they will

485
00:26:00,410 --> 00:26:01,230
hate you to death!

486
00:26:01,230 --> 00:26:01,670
You...

487
00:26:01,700 --> 00:26:02,480
Everyone,

488
00:26:02,500 --> 00:26:03,260
everyone,

489
00:26:03,690 --> 00:26:04,930
keep this in mind.

490
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:06,680
I have checked

491
00:26:06,700 --> 00:26:08,100
your workload one by one.

492
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:10,160
From now on, everything in our plant

493
00:26:10,440 --> 00:26:11,800
depends on efficiency!

494
00:26:11,920 --> 00:26:12,640
If you stay,

495
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,790
you have to earn your living
by your skills.

496
00:26:14,790 --> 00:26:16,480
Only those who can do practical things
for the plant

497
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:17,920
will have a place here!

498
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,990
Let me make this clear today.

499
00:26:20,240 --> 00:26:21,590
If anyone dares to intentionally

500
00:26:21,590 --> 00:26:23,120
make trouble, hold us back,

501
00:26:23,160 --> 00:26:25,220
or sabotage the restructuring work,

502
00:26:25,790 --> 00:26:27,000
don't blame me

503
00:26:28,350 --> 00:26:29,610
for not showing mercy!

504
00:26:30,440 --> 00:26:32,720
Qi Mo, you're something.

505
00:26:32,830 --> 00:26:34,420
You're the director,

506
00:26:34,510 --> 00:26:36,140
and I quit!

507
00:26:36,200 --> 00:26:37,260
-Let's go!
-I quit!

508
00:26:37,270 --> 00:26:37,960
-I quit!
-I quit!

509
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:39,560
I'm not serving you anymore!

510
00:26:40,880 --> 00:26:42,610
Nothing to see here, disperse!

511
00:26:48,880 --> 00:26:49,590
Godfather.

512
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,480
Why didn't you go up?

513
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:52,720
Xiaoyun, well...

514
00:26:53,830 --> 00:26:55,750
I-I was afraid Director Qi

515
00:26:55,750 --> 00:26:56,550
was upstairs,

516
00:26:57,240 --> 00:26:58,840
and I shouldn't disturb him.

517
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:00,590
Well,

518
00:27:00,590 --> 00:27:02,160
Xiaoyun.

519
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:04,750
Qi Mo...

520
00:27:05,590 --> 00:27:07,110
He laid me off.

521
00:27:08,270 --> 00:27:09,400
Just today, I went to see him,

522
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:10,580
and he just told me,

523
00:27:10,600 --> 00:27:12,240
"You can go home."

524
00:27:12,590 --> 00:27:13,590
He just said that

525
00:27:13,620 --> 00:27:15,220
the list has been published.

526
00:27:15,480 --> 00:27:16,760
Even if he doesn't respect me,

527
00:27:16,760 --> 00:27:17,580
he should respect you.

528
00:27:17,580 --> 00:27:18,070
Doesn't he know

529
00:27:18,070 --> 00:27:18,840
who I am?

530
00:27:18,870 --> 00:27:20,140
I'm your godfather.

531
00:27:20,170 --> 00:27:21,170
We are one.

532
00:27:21,190 --> 00:27:21,840
He...

533
00:27:23,550 --> 00:27:24,480
I've spent half my life

534
00:27:24,480 --> 00:27:25,610
in the plant.

535
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:27,760
And he just told me to go home.

536
00:27:27,880 --> 00:27:28,820
Where can I go?

537
00:27:28,840 --> 00:27:29,570
What can I do?

538
00:27:30,270 --> 00:27:31,130
If he really...

539
00:27:31,150 --> 00:27:32,510
If he really pushes me too far,

540
00:27:32,510 --> 00:27:33,400
I'll have no choice.

541
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:34,130
I'll just...

542
00:27:34,220 --> 00:27:34,990
I'll just be

543
00:27:34,990 --> 00:27:35,550
like Wan Yang.

544
00:27:35,550 --> 00:27:37,030
I'll just jump off a building and die.

545
00:27:37,030 --> 00:27:38,110
-I won't care about your reputation

546
00:27:38,110 --> 00:27:39,320
-or what will happen to you.
-Godfather.

547
00:27:39,320 --> 00:27:40,030
Regardless of...

548
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:41,520
-Godfather.
-I won't care whether he is

549
00:27:41,520 --> 00:27:42,180
your husband.

550
00:27:42,180 --> 00:27:42,900
Godfather,

551
00:27:43,140 --> 00:27:44,460
please calm down.

552
00:27:46,770 --> 00:27:48,490
You know the plant's rules

553
00:27:49,530 --> 00:27:50,880
and regulations best.

554
00:27:51,080 --> 00:27:52,490
Qi Mo is in charge.

555
00:27:52,490 --> 00:27:54,880
I-I'm just an accountant.

556
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:57,770
There are some things I can't say

557
00:27:57,930 --> 00:27:59,360
and some things

558
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:01,400
I can't interfere with,

559
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:02,210
right?

560
00:28:03,050 --> 00:28:04,360
I-I know all that.

561
00:28:04,360 --> 00:28:05,050
I...

562
00:28:05,730 --> 00:28:07,530
I understand all these things.

563
00:28:07,530 --> 00:28:08,210
I understand.

564
00:28:08,210 --> 00:28:09,160
I know that you're an accountant,

565
00:28:09,160 --> 00:28:10,360
and that you can't get involved.

566
00:28:10,360 --> 00:28:12,250
And he's the director.

567
00:28:12,250 --> 00:28:13,080
But when you go home,

568
00:28:13,080 --> 00:28:14,320
you can talk to him.

569
00:28:14,840 --> 00:28:15,360
If you talk to him,

570
00:28:15,360 --> 00:28:16,770
he'll listen to you.

571
00:28:16,770 --> 00:28:18,010
To put it bluntly,

572
00:28:18,010 --> 00:28:20,250
your words
are like an imperial edict to him.

573
00:28:20,250 --> 00:28:21,380
He won't ignore you.

574
00:28:22,360 --> 00:28:24,620
When have I ever begged you for anything?

575
00:29:22,340 --> 00:29:24,470
What are you doing? What are you doing?

576
00:29:24,820 --> 00:29:25,920
Are you crazy?

577
00:29:25,950 --> 00:29:27,380
Did you really think I was asleep?

578
00:29:27,380 --> 00:29:28,860
With a psycho like you around,

579
00:29:28,860 --> 00:29:30,230
I can't sleep at all!

580
00:29:30,380 --> 00:29:31,280
You want to die, right?

581
00:29:31,280 --> 00:29:32,410
Go die outside!

582
00:29:32,430 --> 00:29:34,230
Don't cause trouble for me here!

583
00:29:34,800 --> 00:29:35,600
Listen to me, everyone.

584
00:29:35,600 --> 00:29:37,250
Keep a close eye on him, one shift a day!

585
00:29:37,250 --> 00:29:38,120
-Okay, bro.
-Got it.

586
00:29:38,120 --> 00:29:39,320
I'll watch him today.

587
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:41,690
Watch him closely. I'm going to sleep.

588
00:29:41,690 --> 00:29:42,350
Go to sleep.

589
00:29:59,400 --> 00:30:01,430
I know I shouldn't interfere

590
00:30:01,450 --> 00:30:02,600
with your work.

591
00:30:04,530 --> 00:30:05,490
But...

592
00:30:06,560 --> 00:30:08,500
Godfather is all alone.

593
00:30:08,560 --> 00:30:09,770
He's quite pitiful.

594
00:30:10,490 --> 00:30:12,080
And he has been so good to Shan and me

595
00:30:12,080 --> 00:30:13,280
since we were little.

596
00:30:13,320 --> 00:30:14,380
I can't just ignore

597
00:30:15,330 --> 00:30:16,770
his situation.

598
00:30:19,410 --> 00:30:22,080
Godfather Geng Jian

599
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:24,000
knows you're soft-hearted.

600
00:30:25,640 --> 00:30:27,880
But Xiaoyun,

601
00:30:28,800 --> 00:30:30,320
we really shouldn't gossip

602
00:30:30,320 --> 00:30:32,380
about our elders behind their backs.

603
00:30:33,080 --> 00:30:34,050
However,

604
00:30:35,120 --> 00:30:38,450
he's actually not as good

605
00:30:38,930 --> 00:30:39,930
as you think he is.

606
00:30:40,730 --> 00:30:41,690
I know.

607
00:30:42,450 --> 00:30:43,290
After all these years,

608
00:30:43,290 --> 00:30:44,560
how could I not know?

609
00:30:45,120 --> 00:30:46,500
Godfather

610
00:30:47,080 --> 00:30:48,530
is afraid of trouble,

611
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:50,080
wavers easily,

612
00:30:50,690 --> 00:30:52,210
always likes to play the good guy

613
00:30:52,210 --> 00:30:53,410
in front of everyone,

614
00:30:53,930 --> 00:30:55,340
and often

615
00:30:55,690 --> 00:30:57,350
talks behind people's backs.

616
00:30:57,600 --> 00:30:59,010
I know all of this.

617
00:30:59,320 --> 00:31:00,810
But no matter what,

618
00:31:01,160 --> 00:31:02,600
he treats us well.

619
00:31:03,010 --> 00:31:04,530
He has taken care of me for so many years,

620
00:31:04,530 --> 00:31:05,120
and I've called him

621
00:31:05,120 --> 00:31:06,750
Godfather for so long.

622
00:31:08,840 --> 00:31:09,930
Do you have any odd jobs

623
00:31:09,930 --> 00:31:12,290
for him here in our unit?

624
00:31:12,970 --> 00:31:14,930
Just consider it
as helping him in his old age,

625
00:31:14,930 --> 00:31:15,690
okay?

626
00:31:16,250 --> 00:31:17,600
Besides, with his years

627
00:31:17,600 --> 00:31:18,530
of work experience,

628
00:31:18,530 --> 00:31:19,290
he can definitely handle

629
00:31:19,290 --> 00:31:21,050
an ordinary job.

630
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:27,530
Okay.

631
00:31:27,970 --> 00:31:28,930
I promise you.

632
00:31:29,930 --> 00:31:30,690
But

633
00:31:31,360 --> 00:31:32,880
the most important thing for you right now

634
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:34,600
is to take care of your health.

635
00:31:36,080 --> 00:31:37,400
I'll find some time

636
00:31:38,210 --> 00:31:39,120
to talk to him.

637
00:31:41,250 --> 00:31:42,560
You're so sweet.

638
00:32:18,450 --> 00:32:20,080
The personnel adjustments
are going smoothly.

639
00:32:20,080 --> 00:32:20,600
Yes.

640
00:32:21,340 --> 00:32:22,770
As for the restructuring,

641
00:32:22,770 --> 00:32:24,770
there are still some difficulties.

642
00:32:26,050 --> 00:32:26,600
Okay.

643
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:28,730
I'll report to you in detail

644
00:32:29,080 --> 00:32:30,210
when the time comes.

645
00:32:32,080 --> 00:32:33,940
Alright, that's it for now.

646
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:36,840
Director Qi,

647
00:32:36,840 --> 00:32:37,840
you called for me?

648
00:32:38,530 --> 00:32:39,320
Godfather,

649
00:32:41,320 --> 00:32:42,160
Ying,

650
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:42,930
no,

651
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:44,360
Xiaoyun

652
00:32:44,360 --> 00:32:45,770
is pregnant right now

653
00:32:46,080 --> 00:32:47,160
and gets tired easily.

654
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:48,690
So regarding work matters,

655
00:32:48,970 --> 00:32:51,430
there's really no need
for you to bother her.

656
00:32:51,690 --> 00:32:52,560
Yes. Yes.

657
00:32:53,010 --> 00:32:54,840
I had no other choice.

658
00:32:57,290 --> 00:32:58,690
You've seen how many

659
00:32:59,530 --> 00:33:01,250
personnel changes there are in the plant.

660
00:33:01,250 --> 00:33:02,160
And the reform isn't just

661
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:03,360
about you.

662
00:33:03,360 --> 00:33:04,250
Right.

663
00:33:04,560 --> 00:33:05,510
Since

664
00:33:06,800 --> 00:33:08,210
Xiaoyun asked me,

665
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:09,450
I'll transfer you

666
00:33:09,530 --> 00:33:11,400
to the subsidiary
the plant is about to open,

667
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:13,660
and you can be the general manager there.

668
00:33:18,120 --> 00:33:18,930
Director Qi,

669
00:33:19,640 --> 00:33:21,360
does the subsidiary

670
00:33:21,360 --> 00:33:23,530
have to be responsible
for its own profits and losses?

671
00:33:23,530 --> 00:33:25,160
But it's suitable for young people

672
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:25,970
to manage it.

673
00:33:25,970 --> 00:33:27,560
I'm really getting old,

674
00:33:27,560 --> 00:33:28,770
and my health is failing.

675
00:33:28,770 --> 00:33:29,690
I'm mainly afraid

676
00:33:29,690 --> 00:33:31,210
of affecting the subsidiary's development.

677
00:33:31,210 --> 00:33:33,530
Can you transfer me back to the plant?

678
00:33:33,930 --> 00:33:36,120
I'm familiar with the environment
and everything.

679
00:33:36,120 --> 00:33:36,930
Godfather,

680
00:33:37,360 --> 00:33:39,090
the layoff list is already out.

681
00:33:39,250 --> 00:33:40,880
It can't be changed overnight.

682
00:33:40,880 --> 00:33:42,140
Going back to the plant

683
00:33:42,360 --> 00:33:43,880
is absolutely impossible.

684
00:33:43,880 --> 00:33:44,930
But don't worry.

685
00:33:45,250 --> 00:33:46,290
The subsidiary

686
00:33:46,320 --> 00:33:48,540
is also owned by the head office.

687
00:33:48,690 --> 00:33:50,890
The head office will provide projects.

688
00:33:51,020 --> 00:33:52,420
As for the business side,

689
00:33:52,490 --> 00:33:54,150
you don't need to worry at all.

690
00:34:27,560 --> 00:34:28,620
What are you doing?

691
00:34:28,969 --> 00:34:30,030
What are you doing?

692
00:34:31,050 --> 00:34:32,290
Spit it out!

693
00:34:45,850 --> 00:34:47,489
You don't deserve to be Chen Fu's son.

694
00:34:47,489 --> 00:34:48,600
I'm going to teach you a lesson

695
00:34:48,600 --> 00:34:50,000
on behalf of your father.

696
00:34:52,969 --> 00:34:54,199
You want to die, huh?

697
00:34:54,489 --> 00:34:55,850
Dying is easy.

698
00:35:02,080 --> 00:35:04,250
Dying is the easiest thing.

699
00:35:07,530 --> 00:35:08,860
Stop! Stop!

700
00:35:09,050 --> 00:35:09,680
Behave yourself!

701
00:35:09,680 --> 00:35:10,540
What happened?

702
00:35:10,810 --> 00:35:11,830
Report!

703
00:35:12,200 --> 00:35:13,280
He was trying to kill himself.

704
00:35:13,280 --> 00:35:14,280
Squat down!

705
00:35:24,240 --> 00:35:25,200
Hello.

706
00:35:27,930 --> 00:35:29,930
You said Shan tried to kill himself?

707
00:35:31,930 --> 00:35:34,130
Okay, I'll be there as soon as possible.

708
00:35:38,470 --> 00:35:41,070
[Wugang Prison, Jiangnan Province]

709
00:35:47,850 --> 00:35:48,490
Xiaoyun.

710
00:35:49,890 --> 00:35:51,450
When you go in to see Chen Shan later,

711
00:35:51,450 --> 00:35:52,600
don't get worked up.

712
00:35:52,810 --> 00:35:54,410
Don't upset the baby.

713
00:36:01,490 --> 00:36:02,850
I'm here to see Chen Shan.

714
00:36:02,850 --> 00:36:03,720
In Room 5.

715
00:36:03,850 --> 00:36:04,410
Okay.

716
00:36:47,370 --> 00:36:48,010
Shan.

717
00:36:48,450 --> 00:36:50,410
Chen Shan, please keep walking.

718
00:37:02,600 --> 00:37:03,370
Shan.

719
00:37:09,560 --> 00:37:10,360
-Shan.
-Ying.

720
00:37:17,630 --> 00:37:18,810
Who hit you?

721
00:37:20,050 --> 00:37:21,560
N-Nothing, Ying.

722
00:37:22,450 --> 00:37:23,240
Shan,

723
00:37:23,490 --> 00:37:25,330
why are you so foolish?

724
00:37:27,600 --> 00:37:29,200
Don't do anything stupid.

725
00:37:29,310 --> 00:37:30,160
Three years will pass by

726
00:37:30,160 --> 00:37:31,600
very quickly,

727
00:37:31,600 --> 00:37:32,520
you know?

728
00:37:32,520 --> 00:37:33,890
You have to be good.

729
00:37:34,760 --> 00:37:35,330
Ying,

730
00:37:36,160 --> 00:37:37,450
this was the only way

731
00:37:37,450 --> 00:37:38,560
I could see you.

732
00:37:42,160 --> 00:37:43,890
Are you stupid, Chen Shan?

733
00:37:44,660 --> 00:37:45,600
You ruined yourself

734
00:37:45,600 --> 00:37:47,030
just to see me.

735
00:37:47,720 --> 00:37:49,010
If something happened to you,

736
00:37:49,010 --> 00:37:49,970
what would I do?

737
00:37:51,160 --> 00:37:51,980
Shan.

738
00:37:55,760 --> 00:37:58,240
Don't cry, Ying. Don't cry.

739
00:37:58,560 --> 00:37:59,720
I have something very important

740
00:37:59,720 --> 00:38:00,640
to tell you.

741
00:38:01,760 --> 00:38:02,450
Shan,

742
00:38:02,470 --> 00:38:04,330
I have something to tell you too.

743
00:38:04,330 --> 00:38:05,650
Wait a minute.

744
00:38:05,720 --> 00:38:06,760
No, Ying.

745
00:38:11,010 --> 00:38:12,280
Ying, Qi Mo—

746
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:13,200
I'm pregnant.

747
00:38:17,010 --> 00:38:18,770
What about Qi Mo?

748
00:38:20,600 --> 00:38:21,560
Don't worry.

749
00:38:22,850 --> 00:38:24,200
Qi Mo is very good to me.

750
00:38:24,640 --> 00:38:26,530
He will take good care

751
00:38:26,530 --> 00:38:27,640
of me and the baby.

752
00:38:28,330 --> 00:38:29,160
Shan.

753
00:38:29,850 --> 00:38:30,850
You have to listen to me.

754
00:38:30,850 --> 00:38:32,470
Stay alive.

755
00:38:32,540 --> 00:38:34,910
[Wugang County People's Hospital]
[Ultrasound Examination Report]

756
00:38:34,080 --> 00:38:35,450
Three years will go by fast.

757
00:38:34,950 --> 00:38:35,770
[Name: Peng Xiaoyun]

758
00:38:36,640 --> 00:38:37,760
When you get out,

759
00:38:37,760 --> 00:38:39,120
this child will be able

760
00:38:39,120 --> 00:38:40,050
to run after you

761
00:38:40,050 --> 00:38:41,110
and call you Uncle.

762
00:38:44,370 --> 00:38:46,430
Didn't you have something to tell me?

763
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:54,970
Shan.

764
00:38:57,330 --> 00:38:58,050
Shan.

765
00:39:05,890 --> 00:39:06,530
Shan.

766
00:39:06,530 --> 00:39:07,010
Ying.

767
00:39:09,410 --> 00:39:10,610
Wait for me to get out.

768
00:39:13,080 --> 00:39:14,440
Protect yourself.

769
00:39:20,730 --> 00:39:22,090
[Wugang County People's Hospital]
[Ultrasound Examination Report]

770
00:39:21,460 --> 00:39:22,540
Shan.

771
00:39:25,530 --> 00:39:26,380
Shan.

772
00:39:30,930 --> 00:39:31,740
Shan.

773
00:39:40,930 --> 00:39:41,760
Be careful.

774
00:40:14,490 --> 00:40:15,530
Let's go home.

775
00:40:31,540 --> 00:40:37,590
[Wugang Prison, Jiangnan Province]

776
00:40:43,200 --> 00:40:43,760
Come on.

777
00:40:44,560 --> 00:40:45,880
Careful, careful.

778
00:40:47,560 --> 00:40:48,160
Sit here.

779
00:40:48,970 --> 00:40:49,760
Take a rest.

780
00:40:51,450 --> 00:40:52,970
It's been a long day.

781
00:40:53,120 --> 00:40:54,850
Don't exhaust yourself, okay?

782
00:40:55,490 --> 00:40:56,970
I'll heat up the chicken soup for you.

783
00:40:56,970 --> 00:40:57,720
If you feel tired,

784
00:40:57,720 --> 00:40:59,450
just lie down for a while, okay?

785
00:41:11,490 --> 00:41:12,870
About Shan,

786
00:41:13,530 --> 00:41:14,740
I really think

787
00:41:14,770 --> 00:41:16,430
you shouldn't worry too much.

788
00:41:16,850 --> 00:41:17,710
Think about it.

789
00:41:17,720 --> 00:41:18,970
Three years

790
00:41:19,010 --> 00:41:20,640
actually passes by very quickly.

791
00:41:20,640 --> 00:41:21,930
When he gets out,

792
00:41:22,010 --> 00:41:23,080
we will

793
00:41:23,330 --> 00:41:24,560
figure something out together,

794
00:41:24,560 --> 00:41:25,370
okay?

795
00:41:26,200 --> 00:41:26,810
Qi Mo—

796
00:41:26,810 --> 00:41:27,680
I'm pregnant.

797
00:41:40,450 --> 00:41:41,850
Why are you looking at me?

798
00:41:48,080 --> 00:41:49,050
Do I look good?

799
00:41:52,530 --> 00:41:53,760
Be careful.

800
00:41:56,420 --> 00:41:57,490
You're so good to me.
